{"id":"1cd2a39dee160249","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-fixed-point-computation.md","title":"Two Explicit Fixed-Point Computations","display":"ex-fixed-point-computation — Two Explicit Fixed-Point Computations","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-fixed-point-computation","aliases":["89-ex-fixed-point-computation"],"display":"ex-fixed-point-computation — Two Explicit Fixed-Point Computations","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","[[89-df-fixed-point]]","[[89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point]]","[[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]]","[[89-lem-normal-replacement]]","[[89-lem-gl-normal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-fixed-point-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-fixed-point-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-fixed-point-computation — Two Explicit Fixed-Point Computations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc27d1abcea524e3\" href=\"?note=dc27d1abcea524e3\" title=\"89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point\">89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a04766d8c28cddc\" href=\"?note=7a04766d8c28cddc\" title=\"89-thm-letterless-rank-trace\">89-thm-letterless-rank-trace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2d3d18f0211ece52\" href=\"?note=2d3d18f0211ece52\" title=\"89-lem-normal-replacement\">89-lem-normal-replacement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ccac24cdfa254e90\" href=\"?note=ccac24cdfa254e90\" title=\"89-lem-gl-normal\">89-lem-gl-normal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_6=\\Box p\\to\\Box\\neg p\">\\(A_6=\\Box p\\to\\Box\\neg p\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_6=\\Box\\Box\\bot\\to\\Box\\bot\">\\(H_6=\\Box\\Box\\bot\\to\\Box\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 是弱不动点集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为原书加强且不添加字母的谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_{A_6}\">\\(t_{A_6}\\)</span> 是有界 A-trace，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}\">\\(\\mathrm{md}\\)</span> 为模态度数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\top\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\n\\land(\\top\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A_6,p,H_6),\\\\\n&amp;t_{A_6}(p,0)=1\\land t_{A_6}(p,1)=0\n\\land\\forall k\\ge2\\;t_{A_6}(p,k)=1,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{md}(A_6)=1\\land\\mathrm{md}(H_6)=2.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\top\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\n\\land(\\top\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A_6,p,H_6),\\\\\n&amp;t_{A_6}(p,0)=1\\land t_{A_6}(p,1)=0\n\\land\\forall k\\ge2\\;t_{A_6}(p,k)=1,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{md}(A_6)=1\\land\\mathrm{md}(H_6)=2.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 105、109–111；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>保留原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 例子。第二个是原书表第 6 行，计算如下：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>秩</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\neg p\">\\(\\Box\\neg p\\)</span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_6\">\\(A_6\\)</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ge2\">\\(\\ge2\\)</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>两盒列均已稳定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=b_{\\Box}(A_6)=2\">\\(n=b_{\\Box}(A_6)=2\\)</span>，尾部为 1，仅秩 1 缺失，算法给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg R_1\">\\(\\neg R_1\\)</span>。它命题等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_6\">\\(H_6\\)</span>；由有界构造、无字母迹等价和正规替换得到加强不动点条件。这里度数确实增加；不是把“盒子公式数界”误写成“原公式度数界”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-letterless-rank-trace","status":"resolved","id":"7a04766d8c28cddc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-replacement","status":"resolved","id":"2d3d18f0211ece52","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-replacement]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-normal","status":"resolved","id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A_6=\\Box p\\to\\Box\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"H_6=\\Box\\Box\\bot\\to\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"t_{A_6}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{md}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}computation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\top\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\Box p,p)\n\\land(\\top\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n&\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A_6,p,H_6),\\\\\n&t_{A_6}(p,0)=1\\land t_{A_6}(p,1)=0\n\\land\\forall k\\ge2\\;t_{A_6}(p,k)=1,\\\\\n&\\mathrm{md}(A_6)=1\\land\\mathrm{md}(H_6)=2.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"A_6","display":false},{"tex":"\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"n=b_{\\Box}(A_6)=2","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg R_1","display":false},{"tex":"H_6","display":false}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"636cbfa2301b039f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"例子与边界：[[89-ex-fixed-point-computation]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase]]、[[89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum]]、[[89-ex-godel-sentence-modal]]、[[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。练习展开：[[89-lem-fixed-point-valuation]]、[[89-thm-double-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["02536e2efd437c59","85e306b51d3267ec","dc27d1abcea524e3","7a04766d8c28cddc","2d3d18f0211ece52","ccac24cdfa254e90"]}